<h1 data-copy-en="Seraph" data-copy-zh="Seraph">Seraph</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Guidance, crystal access, alignment requirements and artifact visits." data-copy-zh="指引、水晶入口、阵营条件与神器相关会面。">Guidance, crystal access, alignment requirements and artifact visits.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Tutorials_and_Shared_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Twilight_Stone_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Helmet_of_Immortality"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sanctuary_Events_and_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_and_Divine_Glow"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_Seraph"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Seraph — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/seraph.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Seraph — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/seraph.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Seraph — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Seraph offers guidance, a permanent one-time reward and artifact-related visits. Her current activities focus on these services and conversations rather than a separate dating route.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>At Sky-Level Atmospheric Management Station in the Future Fringe Zone, take Cloudy Path to Seraph's Sanctuary. Travel costs 0 minutes and her portrait is available all day.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>At Friend (100), visit for The Eternal War. Stone-recognition scenes only require the corresponding stone in your inventory; they do not require this conversation or higher affection.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Eternal War</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Seraph's Sanctuary</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Helmet of Immortality</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Seraph's Sanctuary</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); Good tier Divine (9th tier) or higher</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Queenstone Awakens</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Seraph's Sanctuary</td><td data-label="Requirements">own Queenstone</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Sword Stone Awakens</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Seraph's Sanctuary</td><td data-label="Requirements">own Sword Stone</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Aether Stone Awakens</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Seraph's Sanctuary</td><td data-label="Requirements">own Aether Stone</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Understanding Your Condition</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Living Room</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Butterfly Effect</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Whispering Woods (Uptown)</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Divine Acknowledgment</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Rose &amp; Thorn</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sashina Stranger (0)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Divine and Infernal Welcome</th><td data-label="Location / start window"></td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Helmet of Immortality requires In Love (3,000) and the Good alignment tier Divine, the 9th tier, or higher. The completed visit grants its named artifact. With an owned Twilight Stone and In Love, Intimate Bonding takes 60 minutes, once per day, for one stone level.</p><p>Her introductory and condition tutorials happen at home; the caterpillar tutorial begins in Whispering Woods (Uptown). Later population milestones belong to the Caterpillar Rearing system.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crystal_Services"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Seraph</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Divine Glow</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); Communication 75</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 direct affection; Attractiveness +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Proficiency Upgrade</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min; 10 Crystals</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">one-time proficiency/home upgrade</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate Bonding</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">In Love (3000); carry Twilight Stone</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 stone level; once/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Divine Glow needs Known (25) and Communication 75 and gives Attractiveness +1 and 8 direct affection, once. Proficiency Upgrade costs 10 Crystals for the one-time proficiency and bedroom upgrade; inspect its own access prompt.</p><p>Her sanctuary also offers Redeem Crystal Code. The full crystal services and artifact effects are covered by the linked system guides.</p><p>Favorite stats are Intelligence, Mystic, Creativity. The learned Intimate Communication skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Stone recognition does not switch on its passive effect; bring the actual owned stone for the visit.</li><li>For the helmet event, affection and the Good alignment tier must both qualify.</li><li>For Proficiency Upgrade check the 10 Crystals and its access prompt rather than raising affection.</li><li>A missing second Divine Glow is normal: the permanent reward is one-time.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-crystals-and-doomsday.html">Crystals</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">Alignment tiers</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-caterpillar-rearing.html">Caterpillar Rearing</a></li><li><a href="character-lillian.html">Lillian</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Tutorials_and_Shared_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Twilight_Stone_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Helmet_of_Immortality"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sanctuary_Events_and_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_and_Divine_Glow"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_Seraph"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Seraph 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/seraph.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Seraph 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/seraph.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Seraph 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Seraph提供指引、一次性永久奖励与神器相关会面，目前的行动以这些服务和交谈为主，没有另一条约会路线。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>到未来边缘区的天空级大气管理站，选择云雾小径进入Seraph的圣所，不消耗时间。她的头像全天出现。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>朋友（100）后可到访进行永恒之战。灵魂石认可事件只要求持有对应石头，不需要先完成这次对话或提高好感。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">永恒之战</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Seraph的圣所</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不朽头盔</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Seraph的圣所</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000）；善良阵营第9阶“神圣”或以上</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">女王石觉醒</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Seraph的圣所</td><td data-label="条件">持有女王石</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">剑石觉醒</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Seraph的圣所</td><td data-label="条件">持有剑石</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">以太之石觉醒</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Seraph的圣所</td><td data-label="条件">持有以太之石</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">了解你的状态</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">客厅</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">蝴蝶效应</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">低语森林（上城区）</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">神圣认可</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">玫瑰与荆棘</td><td data-label="条件">Sashina 陌生人（0）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">神圣与地狱的欢迎</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段"></td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table><p>不朽头盔同时要求恋爱中（3,000）与善良阵营第9阶“神圣”或以上，完成会面后获得同名神器。持有暮光之石并达到恋爱中后，可每天花60分钟选择一次亲密羁绊，使石头提升1级。</p><p>初次与状态教学事件在家中进行，毛虫教学从低语森林（上城区）开始。后续种群里程碑见毛虫饲养指南。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crystal_Services"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Seraph 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">神圣光辉</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；沟通75</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+8；吸引力+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">熟练度升级</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟；水晶×10</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">一次性熟练度与卧室升级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密羁绊</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">恋爱中（3000）；持有暮光之石</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">灵魂石等级+1；每天一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>神圣光辉要求已知（25）与沟通75，一次性给予吸引力+1和8直接好感。熟练度升级消耗10水晶，一次性提升熟练度与升级卧室，另需查看自己的权限提示。</p><p>圣所也可使用兑换水晶码。完整水晶服务与神器效果见下方系统指南。</p><p>偏好的属性为智力、神秘、创造力。学会亲密沟通可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>认可不是灵魂石被动效果生效的条件，但对应会面仍需实际持有石头。</li><li>头盔事件同时检查好感与善良阵营阶级。</li><li>熟练度升级需10水晶与对应权限，不必靠刷好感解锁。</li><li>神圣光辉不会出现第二次，永久奖励仅能领取一次。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-crystals-and-doomsday.html">水晶</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">灵魂石</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">阵营阶级</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-caterpillar-rearing.html">毛虫饲养</a></li><li><a href="character-lillian.html">Lillian</a></li></ul></section>
